OL,3,ABurnham promises to curb non-compete
OL,4,Arules in job contracts
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has promised to curb
OL,7,Fcompanies' ability to restrict what
OL,8,Ftheir workers can do after leaving
OL,9,Ftheir job.
OL,11,FIn a speech, the prime minister said
OL,12,Fthe use of non-compete clauses in
OL,13,Femployment contracts had "gone too far"
OL,14,Fand was holding innovative UK companies
OL,15,Fback.
OL,17,FHe added the clauses had forced workers
OL,18,Fto go without pay after leaving a role,
OL,19,Fas well as making it harder for growing
OL,20,Ffirms to hire new staff.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
